{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Llamalandia is a cozy adventure game with town-building elements, about finding your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a magical journey across the vast mountains of the Bolivian Altiplano, facing many challenges as you build your llama sanctuary to protect those you love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/9834d6ea85f9dfeb95c9602599d8072c.poster.avif?t=1764911288\" width=780 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/9834d6ea85f9dfeb95c9602599d8072c.webm?t=1764911288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live the story from the heart of a llama, feeling the world unfold with every step you take. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey shapes the land around you, and each moment becomes part of the life you are building. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Llamalandia, the adventure is yours to experience, step up and start your story as a llama today! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/899b9fbf2117d18d543cbb2059bafeec.poster.avif?t=1764911288\" width=780 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/899b9fbf2117d18d543cbb2059bafeec.webm?t=1764911288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stunning landscapes, ancient temples, and diverse ecosystems, from golden deserts to snowy peaks touched by magic, the Bolivian highlands are full of animals and surprises waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey brings new discoveries in the enchanting world of Llamalandia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/cedc04b4b443d24260b85ac27b0ae226.poster.avif?t=1764911288\" width=780 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/cedc04b4b443d24260b85ac27b0ae226.webm?t=1764911288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your sanctuary using the treasures you find on your adventures, and watch it grow and thrive as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build cozy homes, farms, and special structures, creating a place where your llama family can rest, grow, and feel loved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/d6fd26e2903a23cbdc80bb288f794e3c.poster.avif?t=1764911288\" width=780 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/d6fd26e2903a23cbdc80bb288f794e3c.webm?t=1764911288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the world of Llamalandia to welcome new llamas into your family, each with their own personality, charm, and a unique bond to share with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise the baby llamas, watch them play, learn, and grow, creating a joyful and thriving family together as you explore new lands alongside your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/4105639ff1357498439bcf8d30b5643a.poster.avif?t=1764911288\" width=780 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/4105639ff1357498439bcf8d30b5643a.webm?t=1764911288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From alpacas and guanacos to armadillos and other adorable animals of the Bolivian highlands, the land is full of friendly faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite them to live in your sanctuary where everyone can feel happy and cared for. Discover, befriend, and share heartwarming moments with every new friend!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2470990?t=1764911288","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/a9746ca09ae9ec291dd5ac7ea348bdc5bdd52f30/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764911288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/bdae5927325b9475168f9d17d7f7b987d09da00f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764911288","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/bdae5927325b9475168f9d17d7f7b987d09da00f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764911288","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3031830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Llamalandia is a cozy adventure game with town-building elements, about finding your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a magical journey across the vast mountains of th